1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I oppose Nick Langworthy's signature piece of legislation, the Energy Choice Act.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
There's a clear contrast between my opponent and I.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
I mean, you heard it from him. He opposes the Energy Choice Act,

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
which would stop Kathy Hocho from banning us from bringing natural gas into our homes.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
He believes that you should be mandated to be in an all-electric home.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
I don't. I think that we, it's a matter of life and death for us to have redundancy

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
in the way we heat our homes in this very difficult climate.

